      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Initial Access",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>You should have the address to your Deploy App instance and a first admin code.</li>\n<li>Login with the code provided.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/883672fe27c04b72.webp",
              "width": 2048,
              "height": 1432
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Callsign",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Give yourself a callsign.</li>\n<li>It will be used across all services.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/84bf77d98ee966a4.webp",
              "width": 2054,
              "height": 1420
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Instructions",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Deploy App has built in instructions to instruct users and highlight key features.</li>\n<li>This guide will go through certificate installation.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "title": "Download the certificate",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>This will act as your way to access the services.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/edf6c9211e881a13.webp",
              "width": 2050,
              "height": 1510
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Install your certificate",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Your callsign acts as your password.</li>\n<li>Type it and press OK untill you are back in Deploy App.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/cdec9e11d1ffdeaa.webp",
              "width": 2052,
              "height": 1432
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Login the certificate",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Press \"Navigate with your key\".</li>\n<li>When prompted to choose a certificate, check that your callsign is selected and press \"Select\" to login.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/cd4aec232634c66a.webp",
              "width": 2050,
              "height": 1436
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Success",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Now you can start using apps as well as enrolling users.</li>\n<li>Deploy App shows you some instructions the first time, or you can look at the instructions on this wiki.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/22b750e5d71b437e.webp",
              "width": 2054,
              "height": 1438
            }
          ]
